olve the puzzles ingeniously created by Ayashii Meiro. Each labyrinth is unique, featuring different themes and challenges. Amy will have to use all her intelligence and skill to unravel the mysteries and defeat the villain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Ayashii Meiro is not the only threat. Along the way, Amy will encounter strange and dangerous creatures that will do anything to stop her. With her courage and determination, Amy must navigate the labyrinths, run through platforms at high speed, and collect the fragments of her soul to reach the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981030/extras/6b3c2081a3faaa7857c2b2ee23028073.poster.avif?t=1769712935\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981030/extras/6b3c2081a3faaa7857c2b2ee23028073.webm?t=1769712935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981030/extras/6b3c2081a3faaa7857c2b2ee23028073.mp4?t=1769712935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each labyrinth completed, Amy gets closer to freedom. Will she be able to overcome the challenges, defeat Ayashii Meiro, and find her way back home? The answer lies in the hands of the player, who must guide Amy through this exciting and mysterious journey in Strange Labyrinth.</p>","developers":["Foxgear GameDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1981030/89fabcaaa9193f4b557a412c0ef4628ea9d94ae6/header.jpg?t=1769712935","is_free":false,"lin